Notes on third-party assets bundled in this repository:

- "DaiDai Worm in Bean Pond" (《呆呆虫之豆豆潭》): original 1990s Windows game
  by Fan Yipeng (樊一鵬). This project is an unofficial, non-commercial 3D
  tribute remake. Any in-game audio or sprite assets derived from the original
  remain the intellectual property of the original author. If you are the
  rights holder and would like attribution adjusted or assets removed, please
  open an issue at https://github.com/tg123/daidai/issues.
- All other source code, art, audio, and content not derived from the
  original game is licensed under the MIT License above.
